<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">A change of your email address was asked for</h1>
  <p>Someone signed in to your Score account asked to change its address from
    <strong><%= user.email %></strong> to <strong><%= new_email %></strong>.
    Nothing changes until the link sent to the new address is followed.</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
    If that was you, there is nothing to do. If it wasn't, choose a new password now: that stops the change and
    signs out every browser signed in to your account.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= reset_url %>"
       style="background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
      It wasn't me: choose a new password
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
